{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日から\n渋谷のTSUTAYAが乃木坂一色です＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『透明な色』の時もすごかったけど\n今回もすごい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/23/9963391/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスツリーとかあって\nもう観光スポット！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回もメンバーそれぞれのブースがあって\nそれぞれの一押し楽曲が書いてあったり\nコメント映像が流れてきたり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、今回も\n店員さんがメンバー一人一人作ってくださった\n手書きの紹介文があるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田の読んだけど、嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/23/9963391/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非、見に行ってきてね( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のブログの続きね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/23/9963391/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サプライズ発表のお話しますよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず\n4th YEAR BIRTHDAY LIVE延期のお知らせ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、A案に決まったってニュースがありましたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2016年問題ね～\n大変なんですね、本当に～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は今アンダーメンバーだから\n選抜だった曲を\n自分の立ち位置で歌える機会がほとんどないけど\nBIRTHDAY LIVEはオリジナルで歌えるんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田にとって\n本当に大事なライブだからめっちゃやりたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず\n中田といっしょに気長に待ちましょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/23/9963391/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう１つ発表されたものがありますね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年、\n紅白歌合戦に乃木坂46が初出場させてもらえるわけですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこで披露させていただける楽曲が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『君の名は希望』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に決まりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/23/9963391/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全メンバーで出演します！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紅白は乃木坂の出演が決定した時、\n紅白に自分は出れるかがわからなくて\n何て言っていいかわからなかったんだよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんに期待させて\n出れなかった時に悲しい思いをさせちゃうのは嫌だし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というか\n自分が、ですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"期待しない方が辛い思いをしないですむから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現に、出れるってなって\n今とても嬉しいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっと言える"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん\n紅白、絶対見てください！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"X'mas Showの時に販売されてた生写真"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/23/9963391/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蝶ネクタイにんまり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}